title: player_fleet_descriptions
---
A ragged but loyal squadron. They will not break.
Held together by will more than steel. Still, they endure.
Veterans of too many wars. They fight like they have nothing left to lose.
Once scattered, now united. Purpose binds them.
Outnumbered, outgunned, but never outmatched in spirit.
A fleet built from survivors. Every ship has a story.
They were not meant to last this long. Yet here they are.
Scarred hulls, steady hands. They know how to win ugly.
A force that refuses extinction.
They carry the weight of every system they've lost.
===

