title: neutral_fleet_descriptions
---
A static defense force. They hold their ground but will not advance.
A holdover from a more glorious time.
Hardly more than brigands.
Their purpose is simple. Hold the line.
Merely decked out miners and farmers.
Cornered and scared, but will not go down without a last fight.
A forgotten defence brigade.
They do not seek conflict. But they will answer it.
A lone planetary defence force. No match for us.
Positioned to defend what matters. Nothing more.
They stand watch over a quiet sky.
A remnant of a former great power.
Few they are, but ready to take up arms to defend their homes.
===

